e": 12644.95, "timestamp": "03:30:44", "text": "例如任何形式的经济支持或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12647.67, "timestamp": "03:30:47", "text": "诸如此类的事情。我的所有内容都是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12649.75, "timestamp": "03:30:49", "text": "免费观看。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12652.469, "timestamp": "03:30:52", "text": "呃，即使我做的是付费内容"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12655.349, "timestamp": "03:30:55", "text": "未来，我希望每个人都能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12658.79, "timestamp": "03:30:58", "text": "买得起，而且基本能买到。"}]